---
folder: C:\Users\ephel\Development\game-store-catalog
description: Scraped catalog of console/PC store games (PlayStation, Xbox, Nintendo, Epic, Steam) with Python build tooling.
github: https://github.com/Ephellon/game-store-catalog.git
---

## Subfolders
* [[psn]] | [[ps4]] | [[ps5]]
> PlayStation game catalog data by platform.
* [[xbox]] | [[xbox-console]] | [[xbox-pc]]
> Xbox game catalog data by platform.
* [[nintendo]] | [[steam]] | [[epic]]
> Nintendo, Steam, and Epic Games catalog data.
* [[esrb]]
> ESRB rating data/assets.

## Files
* metadata.json
> Aggregate catalog metadata (per-store sizes/counts referenced by the README).
* build_metadata.py | push_catalog.py | clean_names.py | update_readme.py
> Pipeline: build metadata, push catalog, normalize game names, regenerate README.
* push_commits.bat | update_readme.bat
> Windows wrappers invoking the push/readme scripts.
* README.md
> Catalog overview and per-store route listing with live counts.
